WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:05.540
When The Handmaid's Tale premiered on Hulu,
you might have noticed quite a few familiar

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:10.080
faces—including Yvonne Strahovski, who plays
Serena Joy.

00:00:10.509 --> 00:00:15.379
If you're wondering where you've seen Strahovski
before, well you're in luck—we've put together

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:18.460
a list of her most visible roles over the
years.

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:19.980
Chuck

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:26.660
For five years, Strahovski played CIA agent
Sarah Walker on the NBC action spy comedy

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.380
Chuck.

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:32.540
Agent Walker is one of the agents assigned
to protect Chuck after he accidentally downloads

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.980
secret government information into his brain.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:39.620
While her primary mission was to keep Chuck
safe from the rogue groups trying to capture

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.160
him, her cover as Chuck's "girlfriend" eventually
became the real deal.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:48.300
Strahovski's character on Chuck was a fan
favorite, and she went on to win both a Teen

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.920
Choice Award and two TV Guide Awards for her
work.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:53.700
Mass Effect

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:58.840
Strahovski first lent her voice to the character
of Miranda Lawson in the mobile spin-off game

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:05.300
Mass Effect Galaxy, then hit the video game
franchise full-time in Mass Effect 2 and the

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:06.680
follow-up, Mass Effect 3.

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:11.340
But she provided more than a voice for the
character — Miranda was actually designed

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:12.920
to look like Strahovski.

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:17.580
"They scanned my face into it and then they
made me brunette.

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:18.660
And then the body is not mine.

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:20.440
The body is not mine!"

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:25.340
Strahovski was nominated for a Spike Video
Game Award for her role as Lawson, and Lawson

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:29.620
has frequently been included in "Hottest Video
Game Character" lists.

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:35.060
If that Mass Effect movie project can ever
get off the ground, here's hoping Strahovski

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:35.860
will be back.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:37.620
Killer Elite

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:42.960
After years of acting mostly in TV shows,
Yvonne Strahovski landed one of her first

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:49.520
big film roles with 2011's Killer Elite, where
she starred as Jason Statham's love interest.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:54.480
Their attempt to start a romance runs into
a few roadblocks along the way, however, and

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:59.320
they both get caught up in a deadly game of
cat and mouse with international killers.

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:04.620
Killer Elite wasn't a massive hit with critics,
but it showcased Strahovski's acting abilities

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:07.620
and primed her career for even bigger roles
to come.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:09.320
The Guilt Trip

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:14.400
In a twist on the traditional road trip movie,
The Guilt Trip chronicles the cross-country

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:19.980
adventure of Joyce and her adult son, Andy,
played by Barbra Streisand and Seth Rogen.

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:24.260
Along the way, of course, two discover a lot
more about themselves than they planned.

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:29.520
Yvonne Strahovski plays a small but memorable
role as one of Andy's old girlfriends who

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:32.040
rescues them when their car breaks down.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:37.500
While it's a relatively small part, Strahovski
definitely helps Streisand turn the awkward

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.460
up to 11 during this cringe-inducing scene.

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:41.920
Dexter

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:47.280
Showtime's serial-killer drama Dexter ran
for eight seasons, and one of the highlights

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:52.770
of the last two of those seasons was the introduction
of Hannah McKay, played by Strahovski, a woman

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:55.500
with secrets just as dark as Dexter's.

00:02:55.900 --> 00:03:01.020
McKay's complicated romantic relationship
with Dexter evolves until the final episode,

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:06.080
and eventually comes to a head as the two
killers attempt to flee the country together.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:11.240
We're not sure how many real relationships
start with attempted murder, but on Dexter,

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.040
what else would you expect?

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:15.200
24: Live Another Day

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:21.560
Although Strahovski played a CIA agent in
both Chuck and 24, the character of Kate Morgan

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:25.630
couldn't be more different from the light-hearted
role of Sarah Walker on Chuck.

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:31.820
In 24: Live Another Day, Morgan is the widow
of another CIA agent who committed suicide

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:34.020
after he was accused of treason.

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:38.800
True to the show's style, Kate Morgan is a
gritty, serious character who doesn't pull

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:44.780
any punches as she ruthlessly tracks down
Jack Bauer and works to uncover his true motives.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:49.560
Along the way, she learns the shocking truth
behind her husband's alleged treason.

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:51.380
I, Frankenstein

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:57.500
This action-fantasy film drops the reanimated
monster of Victor Frankenstein into an epic

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:01.380
struggle between good and evil that makes
its way to the modern day.

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:06.260
Caught in the middle of this conflict is Yvonne
Strahovski's character, Terra, a scientist

00:04:06.269 --> 00:04:12.200
conducting experiments on reanimation for
Naberius, played by Bill Nighy—not realizing

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:13.840
his true nature as a demon.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:19.560
Frankenstein's monster must do his best to
not only defeat Naberius and foil his plans,

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:24.920
but also save Terra before the demon prince
can use her to create an army of undead.

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:26.760
The Astronaut Wives Club

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:34.020
This ABC miniseries aired in 2015 and chronicled
the lives of the wives of the "Mercury Seven"—America's

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:35.420
first astronauts.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:39.880
Set during NASA's most tumultuous period,
the show covers everything from the first

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:43.120
manned American flight in space to the first
moon landing.

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:48.120
While obviously dramatized for television,
it's an intriguing look at women thrust into

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:51.610
the spotlight simply because of who they were
married to.

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:56.650
Strahovski co-stars as Rene Carpenter, wife
of Scott Carpenter, who flew in the second

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.500
orbital mission.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.040
Manhattan Night

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:05.200
In this crime drama from 2016, Strahovski
pairs up with Adrien Brody, who plays Porter,

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:07.360
a crime reporter in New York City.

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:13.460
The pair start an illicit romance when Strahovski's
character, Caroline, contacts him to uncover

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:16.760
information about her husband's recent mysterious
death.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.340
Soon, they find themselves caught up in a
mystery bigger than they'd imagined.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:26.240
Manhattan Night is a stylish modern noir that
didn't make any big waves on its release,

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:28.540
but it showed off Strahovski's acting range.

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:33.560
And now that she's co-starring in Hulu's hit
series The Handmaid's Tale, there's no telling

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:36.280
where Yvonne Strahovski's career will go next.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:37.360
Thanks for watching!

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:39.900
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:42.500
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

